# The A of Satin Doll alone, the one that ends on C held, for the
# lessons of the beginners: eight bars, two chords a bar but the last
# two, its roots on white keys and on A♭ and D♭. Not in the game's
# list (see Files): the whole tune is.

{start_of_grid shape="4x2"}
| Dm7 G7 | Dm7 G7 | Em7 A7 | Em7 A7 |
| Am7 D7 | Abm7 Db7 | Cmaj7 | % |.
{end_of_grid}
